flowchart TD
    Start[Release 1 review starts] --> Product[Product journeys pass]
    Product --> Isolation[Cross-tenant negative tests pass]
    Isolation --> Provision[Provisioning and lifecycle evidence pass]
    Provision --> Recovery[Backup, restore, retry, and closure evidence pass]
    Recovery --> Runtime[DNS/TLS, SSR/BFF, queues, providers, and health evidence pass]
    Runtime --> Security[Security findings reviewed and accepted]
    Security --> Docs[Runbooks, API docs, diagrams, and checklist synchronized]
    Docs --> Pilot[Pilot/internal-alpha evidence reviewed]
    Pilot --> Decision{Release owner decision}
    Decision -- go --> Release[Release 1 approved]
    Decision -- no-go --> Remediate[Create blocker with owner and evidence gap]
    Remediate --> Product

    Note1[Diagrams organize the gate; they do not substitute for execution evidence.] -.-> Docs
    Note2[Unproven production claims remain open.] -.-> Runtime